                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48950d6a-e013-4225-a1cf-5f13f8bdd4a0",
                                "sense_id": "f03a1610-a925-39ae-bfb4-4aa6a365a548",
                                "text": "If the chemicals are too strong, or the sheets remain too long in the bath, or are not thoroughly cleansed from the bleach before they are re-sized, the certain seeds of decay are planted in the paper, and [...] in the course of a few years the enemy will appear, the fibre will decay, and the existence of the books will terminate in a state of white tinder."
